From: Raing5Days <M202574102@hust.edu.cn>
Date: Sun, 30 Aug 2026 15:52:55 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(ascend): split-batch engine integration and cudagraph
 support

InplaceSplitRunner + model_runner_v1 execute_model wiring, acl_graph
offset-key capture with fail-closed eager fallback, acl_graph_split_batch
dispatch/admission, and attention_v1 FIA seq-lens templating hooks.

Wires the primitive modules of the previous PR into the engine behind
split_batch_config.enabled (off by default).
